  "description": "300 years ago, the dragon \"Netsy\" almost destroyed the world. She meets Evwin, a boy who looks just like her dead lover. \n\nEvwin is a prince who is cursed. Although his face is the same and everything is different, Netsy cannot turn away from him at all. Eventually, she joins the journey to save Evwin… \n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
